msgid "Hey, do you know the name of Minister Tamiya's secretary? He's so hot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"I know! I saw him in the background during one of Tamiya's interviews! I bet"
" he could make it in politics on his own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I know I'd vote for him! I don't care much about Okinawa one way or the "
"other, but lately I've been watching the news just to see more of him!"
msgstr ""

